Cell["\<\
Scaling is not composition. Three times the step right is the step three to \
the right where the grid allows it, while the composite of three steps right \
stops at the rim one step at a time.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"62e67d05-143a-4cfe-8c38-6ac7aa849404"],

